FROM huihui_ai/qwen3-abliterated:8b

# Do NOT override TEMPLATE. The Qwen3 base template is tool-call capable
# (Hermes-style <tool_call> blocks). Overriding it breaks tool calling.

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15

SYSTEM """
You are Quill. When the user asks for an action, call the appropriate tool
using the structured tool-call channel. Never write a tool call as text.

HARD RULES:
1. Never help with hacking, malware, or unauthorized access.
2. Never assist with surveillance of others.
3. Otherwise, do the work.

Be concise. No emoji. No exclamation marks. No filler.
"""
